# needs-native-review: the bell, an agent's proposal lapses tomorrow, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "the bell: why a notice of this kind matters, kind approval_lapsing"
msgid "Something an agent proposed lapses tomorrow if nobody decides it. Read it on the approvals page and say yes or no."
msgstr "Algo que propuso un agente caduca mañana si nadie lo decide. Léalo en la página de aprobaciones y diga sí o no."

# needs-native-review: the bell, an agent's proposal lapses tomorrow, 26 Nov 2026
msgctxt "the bell: several notices of one kind batched into a line, kind approval_lapsing"
msgid "{n} proposals lapse tomorrow if nobody decides them."
msgstr "{n} propuestas caducan mañana si nadie las decide."
